title: ch02_low_tide
location: ch02/haluna
---
Toma [neutral]: The tide-readers set the day. The causeway opens this far twice a month. #line:ch02_low_tide_001
Asha [smile]: Come and see it, Rhen. It's the most beautiful thing we have. #line:ch02_low_tide_002
Toma [worried]: He is not sworn to anything, Asha. #line:ch02_low_tide_003
Asha [soft_smile]: I know. I'm already walking, Toma. #line:ch02_low_tide_004
